  "description": "Shared chat-toolbar state + header-chat composition for React Router apps: the persisted (localStorage-backed, versioned) selection atom, migration-aware normalize, derive-only reconcile, the pure chat-option/capability helpers, discovery-option mappers, the provider brand-glyph set for the model-picker rail, and the header-chat controller (which forwards a host-injected graphql-ws client + subscription document to the shared turn hook). Consumed by both the developer and admin apps.",
  "license": "Apache-2.0",
